AWS 

EC2 instance
ec2  --> elastic compute cloud

steps --> seven (7) steps

1. Name & tag = to identify

2. AMI = Amazon Machine Image
   OS, software, and packages already installed
   OS to communicate btw user & machine

3. Instance Type = Hardware (CPU & RAM)
T2.Micro = 1-cpu & 1-Ram : FREE

4. Keypair = login
Types :
1. public -> managed by AWS
2. private managed by user --> (PEM & PPK)

5. Network = VPC & Security-Group (SG)
vpc = privacy, security & isolation
Types: 
1. default
2. custom
SG allows all traffic
port: 0 - 65535
ssh --> 22: used to connect to the server

6. storage = EBS --> elastic block storage
default = 8gb  max = 16
Up to 30gb it is free

7. summary

